SOURCE-AVAILABLE. THIS IS NOT OPEN SOURCE.

The source is published so that the central claim can be checked: that
inference runs locally, that the index is on disk, and that nothing leaves the
machine without a logged, consented decision. That claim cannot be
substantiated by a closed binary, and reading the code is how you verify it.
Auditability is the whole reason this repository is public.

